{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 9, :comments ["<b>ופקדתי</b> — \"the leaping ones\": those who come to fill their masters' house with violence and deceit, out of their great joy, when they enter the king's house to bring in that violence, as they cross the threshold of the house it is as though they leap from great joy at the threshold of the rulers' house. These are the officers who take a man's labor by force, or by deceit, to curry favor with their masters."], :book :zephaniah, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 1, :notes {0 "The lemma reads ופקדתי but the comment clearly glosss the phrase הדולג על־המפתן from Zephaniah 1:9; the lemma as transmitted appears truncated or misplaced."}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Zephaniah -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/zfanya"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:47:13.386266440Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}